# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# Nothing in this repo requires a key to function. Every value below is optional
# and unlocks one specific extra behaviour. The agents are explicitly forbidden
# from reading this file (see .claude/settings.json) — these variables are read
# by the shell, never opened as a file by Claude.

# Optional. Lets video-scout rank topic suggestions by view count instead of
# just listing published videos. Without it, video-scout uses yt-dlp, which
# needs no key and is sufficient for gap analysis.
# Get one from a free Google Cloud project: https://console.cloud.google.com
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
